msgid "Sindoor Valour"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A dignified, accessible WordPress theme for veterans welfare trusts, regimental benevolent funds and armed-forces family support NGOs. Built around the work such organisations actually do: welfare programmes, beneficiary stories, donation appeals, commemorations and notices. Ships with a sectioned front page, a donation call-to-action template, full keyboard and screen-reader support, and a print stylesheet for receipts and notices. Independent and unofficial; it carries no government or military insignia."
msgstr ""

