#: inc/starter-content.php:41
msgid "Who we are"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:42
msgid "We are a registered charitable trust working with veterans, war widows and the families of serving personnel. Our work is unglamorous and long-term: school fees paid on time, a hospital bill settled, a pension file followed up until it moves, a trade certificate that leads to a job."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:43
msgid "Everything we do is funded by regular donors and audited annually. Replace this text with your own introduction, and the figures above with numbers your trust can account for."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:62
msgid "This page is where you set out what the trust exists to do, who it serves and who runs it. Keep it concrete: the districts you cover, the year you were registered, the registration number, and the names of the trustees."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:63
msgid "How we work"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:64
msgid "Applications come through the district sainik welfare office or directly from the family. Every case is verified against service records before any assistance is released, and assistance is paid to the institution or hospital rather than in cash."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:65
msgid "Governance"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:66
msgid "List your trustees, your auditor, and where the annual report and accounts can be read. Donors ask, and a trust that answers before being asked raises more."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:81
msgid "Replace this page with your own giving instructions. The theme deliberately does not collect payments: put your payment gateway shortcode, your UPI handle or your bank details here, whichever your trust actually uses."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:82
msgid "What a contribution covers"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:86
msgid "One school year for a child, including fees, books and uniform."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:87
msgid "A district medical camp, including medicines and a visiting physician."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:88
msgid "A trade certification course for a veteran entering civilian work."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:91
msgid "Bank transfer"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:92
msgid "Account name, account number, IFSC and branch go here. Add your 80G registration details if your trust holds one, and say plainly what a donor will receive as a receipt."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:107
msgid "Office address, helpline number, email and the hours the office is actually open. If families have to travel to reach you, say which day of the week the welfare officer sits in."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:108
msgid "Applying for assistance"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:109
msgid "List the documents a family should bring: discharge book, pension payment order, the child's previous mark sheet, and the hospital estimate where the application is for medical aid."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:175
msgid "Scholarships for children"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:176
msgid "Full-year school and college fees, books and uniforms for the children of veterans and war widows, paid directly to the institution."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:177
msgid "The scholarship covers tuition, examination fees, books and one set of uniform for a full academic year. Payment is made to the school or college, never in cash, and is renewed on the strength of the previous year's results. Applications open in April and close at the end of June."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:181
msgid "Medical assistance"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:182
msgid "Quarterly medical camps, hospital referrals and reimbursement of treatment costs that fall outside the family's entitlement."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:183
msgid "A visiting physician holds a camp in each district every quarter, with basic diagnostics and a month's medicines. Cases that need hospital care are referred to a panel hospital, and the trust settles the portion of the bill that is not covered by the family's existing entitlement."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:184
msgid "Health"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:187
msgid "Skilling and placement"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:188
msgid "Trade certification, interview preparation and placement support for veterans moving into civilian employment."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:189
msgid "Veterans leaving service in their forties have two decades of working life ahead of them and a skill set that civilian employers often fail to read. The programme pays for a recognised trade certificate, rewrites the service record as a civilian CV, and introduces the candidate to employers who have hired from the programme before."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:193
msgid "Pension and records assistance"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:194
msgid "Help with pension files, corrections to service records and the paperwork a family faces after a bereavement."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:195
msgid "A stalled pension file is the most common problem a widow brings to the office, and it is almost always a paperwork problem rather than an entitlement one. The trust keeps a welfare officer who knows the forms, follows the file until it moves, and tells the family plainly where it has reached."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:196
msgid "Entitlements"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:201
msgid "District medical camp"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:202
msgid "Open to all registered beneficiaries. Carry your discharge book and canteen card."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:203
msgid "General physician, eye screening and blood sugar testing, with one month of medicines issued on the spot. Registration opens at 8:30 am and the last token is issued at 1 pm."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:205
msgid "District Sainik Welfare Office"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:208
msgid "Scholarship application help desk"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:209
msgid "Bring last year's mark sheet and the school fee structure. Forms are filled in and submitted on the spot."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:210
msgid "A welfare officer will fill in the form with you, check the documents against your service record, and give you an acknowledgement with the file number before you leave."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:212
msgid "Trust Office, Ground Floor"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:215
msgid "Annual commemoration and family day"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:216
msgid "The yearly gathering of beneficiary families, with the annual report read out and accounts placed on the table."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:217
msgid "The trustees present the year's accounts, the scholarship results are read out, and families who have moved into employment through the skilling programme speak about it themselves. Lunch is provided."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:219
msgid "Community Hall"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:224
msgid "Scholarship applications are open"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:225
msgid "Applications for the coming academic year are open until the end of June. Forms are available at the district office and at the help desk."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:226
msgid "Applications for the coming academic year are open. Families already on the register do not need to apply again; a renewal form will be sent to the address we hold. New applicants should bring the discharge book, the pension payment order and the child's previous mark sheet to the district office."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:229
msgid "Medical camp reaches its four hundredth family"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:230
msgid "The quarterly camp crossed four hundred families this month, with eye screening added to the standard set of tests."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:231
msgid "The quarterly camp crossed four hundred families this month. Eye screening has been added to the standard set of tests after last year's camps found untreated cataracts in a third of the veterans over seventy who attended."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:234
msgid "Annual report and accounts published"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:235
msgid "The audited accounts and the trustees' report for the year are now available to read and download."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:236
msgid "The audited accounts and the trustees' report for the year are now published. They set out what was received, what was spent on each programme, and what the trust holds in reserve. Donors who would like a printed copy can ask at the office."
msgstr ""

